---
title: Notes · from a keystroke to a committed revision
---
flowchart TB
  edit(["`**Edit in the note**
  Block model updated once per run-loop turn`"]):::people
  protect[("`**Protect the draft**
  NotesDrafts.sqlite · base revision · mutation id`")]:::local
  queue{{"`**Per-note save queue**
  650 ms debounce · one save in flight`"}}:::gate
  send["`**update_note**
  command id = mutation id
  expected_revision = base`"]:::backend
  ok(["`**Committed**
  Draft re-based or cleared
  Newer typing kept on top`"]):::backend
  moved{"`Revision moved?`"}:::gate
  merge["`**Block merge**
  Base version from note_versions
  Combine edits to different blocks`"]:::app
  same{"`Same block changed
  on both sides?`"}:::gate
  compare(["`**Compare versions**
  Save my version or keep the cloud's`"]):::external
  offline(["`**Offline or failed**
  Draft stays protected · retried on reconnect`"]):::async

  edit --> protect --> queue --> send --> moved
  moved -->|no| ok
  moved -->|yes| merge --> same
  same -->|no| send
  same -->|yes| compare
  send async_1@-.->|no answer| offline
  offline async_2@-.->|connection back| queue
